# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# model/ — the FastAPI server + training script. See the root .gitignore for
# secrets, __pycache__ and OS junk.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# The original Colab export. Everything in it is already unpacked alongside, so
# it is 3.5 MB of duplicate that would ship to Render for no reason.
artifacts/winscope_model_artifacts.zip

# The exported VotingClassifier (6.8 MB). The server averages the five .ubj
# boosters instead, which is bit-identical and does not pin an sklearn version.
# Un-ignore it if you ever want to load it directly.
artifacts/xgboost_tuned.pkl

# Colab/notebook leftovers from a training run.
train/*.ipynb_checkpoints/
train/runs/
*.joblib

# --- deliberately NOT ignored ----------------------------------------------
# artifacts/xgboost_seed*.ubj  the five boosters the server actually loads
#                              (~7 MB total). Render builds from the repo and
#                              does not retrain, so these MUST be committed.
# artifacts/*.json             elo/pi ratings, form, h2h, tables, feature
#                              defaults and label maps — all serving inputs.
